  "preconditions": [
    "LocaleDataWrapper short order is constructed only through a mapping returning MDY, DMY or YMD, even on fallback.",
    "Original GetDateOrder and compiled-format GetDateOrder return those literals or that actual cached short order.",
    "Both exact-order producers append only ASCII D/M/Y and at most three particles; the exact-two-particle bound excludes zero/one/three-particle encodings.",
    "The original single-numeric classifier calls only start/end scanners; other classifiers and resets assign month position only0/1/2/3. No private mutation, method replacement or invented provider is admitted.",
    "The era flag is a plain Boolean initialized/reset true and assigned false by signed-year handling; the original default-era constant is true. No callback/state change occurs between guard and argument evaluation."
  ],
